    <title>Cat FAQ</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        --bg: #f4f7fb;
        --surface: #ffffff;
        --surface-2: #f8fafc;
        --text: #122033;
        --muted: #5b687a;
        --border: #d9e2ee;
        --accent: #4f7cff;
        --accent-soft: rgba(79, 124, 255, 0.12);
        --shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(18, 32, 51, 0.08);
        --radius: 20px;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        color: var(--text);
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(79, 124, 255, 0.14), transparent 34%),
          radial-gradient(circle at right top, rgba(119, 227, 189, 0.18), transparent 28%),
          var(--bg);
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .skip-link {
        position: absolute;
        left: 1rem;
        top: 1rem;
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--surface);
        color: var(--text);
        border: 2px solid var(--accent);
        transform: translateY(-180%);
        transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        z-index: 10;
      }

      .skip-link:focus {
        transform: translateY(0);
        outline: none;
      }

      main {
        width: min(960px, calc(100% - 2rem));
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
      }

      .hero {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92));
        border: 1px solid rgba(217, 226, 238, 0.9);
        border-radius: 28px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--accent-soft);
        color: #2446b7;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
        line-height: 1.05;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      }

      .lead {
        max-width: 65ch;
        margin: 1rem 0 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      .faq-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .example {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(18, 32, 51, 0.04);
        overflow: clip;
      }

      .details {
        display: block;
      }

      .details summary {
        list-style: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1rem;
        padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 1.02rem;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .details summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
      }

      .details summary::after {
        content: "";
        width: 0.75rem;
        height: 0.75rem;
        border-right: 2px solid currentColor;
        border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor;
        transform: rotate(45deg);
        transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        flex: none;
        margin-top: -0.15rem;
      }

      .details[open] summary::after {
        transform: rotate(-135deg);
      }

      .details summary:hover {
        background: var(--surface-2);
      }

      .details summary:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
        outline-offset: -3px;
        background: var(--surface-2);
      }

      .details .answer {
        padding: 0 1.2rem 1.2rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .details .answer p {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .details .answer p + p {
        margin-top: 0.75rem;
      }

      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        main {
          width: min(100% - 1rem, 960px);
          padding-top: 4rem;
        }

        .hero {
          border-radius: 22px;
        }

        .details summary {
          padding-inline: 1rem;
        }

        .details .answer {
          padding-inline: 1rem;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        html {
          scroll-behavior: auto;
        }

        .skip-link,
        .details summary::after {
          transition: none;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>
    <main id="main-content">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">Product FAQ</p>
        <h1 id="page-title">Cats, answered clearly.</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          A compact FAQ for the most common cat questions, with each answer collapsed by default
          and ready to expand when you need it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="faq-list" aria-label="Frequently asked questions about cats">
        <div class="example">
          <details class="details">
            <summary>Why do cats purr?</summary>
            <div class="answer">
              <p>
                Cats purr for comfort, communication, and self-soothing. It often means they feel
                relaxed, but cats may also purr when they are hurt or stressed.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <details class="details">
            <summary>How much sleep do cats need?</summary>
            <div class="answer">
              <p>
                Most cats sleep 12 to 16 hours a day, and kittens or senior cats can sleep even
                more. Their energy spikes come in short bursts between long naps.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <details class="details">
            <summary>Why do cats knead with their paws?</summary>
            <div class="answer">
              <p>
                Kneading is a comforting behavior that starts in kittenhood. Adult cats often keep
                doing it when they feel safe, content, or especially attached to a person or spot.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <details class="details">
            <summary>Should cats eat the same food every day?</summary>
            <div class="answer">
              <p>
                Consistency helps many cats, but the food should also be complete and balanced for
                their age and health needs. If you change brands or flavors, do it gradually.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="example">
          <details class="details">
            <summary>Do indoor cats still need enrichment?</summary>
            <div class="answer">
              <p>
                Yes. Scratching posts, climbing spots, puzzle feeders, and daily play help indoor
                cats stay active, curious, and mentally healthy.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
